
---

### `.gitignore`

Here’s a `.gitignore` file for your project:

```plaintext
# Python
*.pyc
*.pyo
__pycache__/
*.sqlite3

# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/

# Django
*.log
*.pot
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.db
*.sqlite3
media/
staticfiles/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Test Coverage
htmlcov/
.coverage
*.cover
*.py,cover

# Pytest
.cache/

# Pip
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# IDEs
.idea/
*.swp